1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
This is the most expensive school in the world.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,370
And when you hear what parents pay here every single year, you're going to lose your mind.

3
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:10,500
Look. This is Institut Le Rosey, on the shores of Lake Geneva in Switzerland.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,800
They call it the School of Kings, because REAL kings of Spain and Belgium studied here.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,920
Even the Rockefellers send their kids here.

6
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:21,500
It has just 400 students, and 200 staff serving them.

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:28,300
Every January the ENTIRE school packs up and moves to a ski resort in the Alps, because skiing is literally in the syllabus.

8
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:32,000
Private concert hall. Horse stables. Sailing boats on the lake.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,460
Meanwhile, your school couldn't even fix one ceiling fan.

10
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:38,100
And the fees for all of this?

11
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:44,020
One hundred and thirty THOUSAND dollars. Every. Single. Year.
